### Request Example

- POST

```json
{
    "bk_scope_type": "biz",
    "bk_scope_id": "2",
    "job_plan_id": 50001,
    "name": "my-api-plan",
    "enable_steps": [
        201,
        203
    ],
    "variables": [
        {
            "name": "TARGET_DIR",
            "value": "/data/release-v2",
            "follow_template": false
        },
        {
            "name": "HOST_TARGET",
            "follow_template": false,
            "execute_target": {
                "host_list": [
                    {
                        "bk_host_id": 10001
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

