#### data

| Field           | Type    | Description                                                                                        |
|-----------------|---------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| bk_scope_type   | string  | Resource scope type. Allowed values: `biz` (business), `biz_set` (business set)                    |
| bk_scope_id     | string  | Resource scope ID                                                                                  |
| job_plan_id     | long    | Job plan ID                                                                                        |
| job_plan_name   | string  | Job plan name                                                                                      |
| job_template_id | long    | Job template ID                                                                                    |
| creator         | string  | Creator                                                                                            |
